abstract: >-
  Benjamin Stanley Frohman is the originator of the Frohmanian Symplectic Tether.
  The Lean domain is T3 := EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin 3). Fefferman's statement (B)
  is the periodic torus, and neither regularity head is that statement.
  ns_global_regularity_of_cubic_damped_rate assumes the cubic vorticity rate
  and does not derive it. global_regularity_for_NS assumes a vorticity ceiling
  and does not derive it.
notes: >-
  The mathematical proofs are those of Benjamin Stanley Frohman. The Lean 4
  encoding was compiled in collaboration with an AI assistant (Grok, xAI)
  from the author's paper proofs.
